OL,3,GNEWSAAmputee gets blue badge and calls
OL,4,Afor review
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 71-year-old amputee said he was
OL,7,F"relieved" to finally have his blue
OL,8,Fbadge approved and has called for the
OL,9,Fpermit's reapplication process to be
OL,10,Freviewed.
OL,12,FNigel Ward, from West Winch near King's
OL,13,FLynn, reapplied to Norfolk County
OL,14,FCouncil for the parking permit but was
OL,15,Frejected and told he needed to provide
OL,16,Fmore evidence of his limited mobility.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
