OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAAmputee gets blue badge and calls
OL,4,Afor review
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was later assessed by a
OL,7,Fphysiotherapist and his application was
OL,8,Fapproved by the authority, which said
OL,9,Fit had been following the process set
OL,10,Fout by the Department for Transport
OL,11,F(DfT).
OL,13,FNorfolk County Council has backed
OL,14,FWard's call for the DfT to make the
OL,15,Fprocess easier for people who are
OL,16,Fpermanently disabled.
